CountedReplacement:
    @Match: matched
    return: []char
    make:
        changed += 1
        return: replacement

Example:
    []char: text
    []char: needle
    []char: replacement
    return: @
    run:
        throws: copy(byteText\throws) copy(replace\throws)
        int: changed 0
        []char: out replace(byteText(text); needle; CountedReplacement\make)
        return: (out; changed)
